  "result": "Perfect! All 45 tests pass (32 original + 13 new). Here's what I added:\n\n\u2705 **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds or updates a line\n- Adds new line at the end if SKU doesn't exist\n- Increases qty if SKU already exists\n- Validates qty (QTY_INVALID) and SKU (UNKNOWN_SKU) with same rules as `createInvoice`\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n\u2705 **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line by SKU\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU not on invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if removing would leave zero lines\n- Never mutates the original invoice\n\n\u2705 **Updated `src/errors.js`** with two new error codes:\n- LINE_NOT_FOUND\n- NOT_DRAFT\n\n\u2705 **Comprehensive tests** (13 new) covering:\n- Adding new lines and updating existing SKUs\n- All validation failures (qty, SKU)\n- Status protection (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Preventing empty invoices\n- Immutability of input invoices",
